<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh industry output rose 4.5 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Kazakh industry output rose 4.5 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan industrial production rose 4.5 percent in October but was 9.5 percent lower than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	 OCT 96    SEP 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	 +4.5	+1.7	+9.4</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	   -9.5	+0.1     -10.4</p>
<p>Industrial production in the first 10 months of this year was 0.9 percent lower than a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
